o the Obligors and the Agents, assign or novate all or any of its rights, benefits and obligations hereunder, to any bank or financial institution or other Person.\",\n          \"clauseText\": \"The Lender may, without prior intimation to the Obligors and the Agents (a) assign in accordance with Clause 2.19.2 all or any of its rights, benefits and obligations hereunder, or (b) novate in accordance with Clause 2.19.3 below, all or any part of its rights, benefits and obligations hereunder, to any bank or financial institution or other Person.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"penalty_clauses\": [\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"2.3.1\",\n      \"description\": \"Additional interest of 1% per annum over and above the applicable Interest Rate from the expiry of stipulated time for compliance with terms of Sanction and Agreement, including filing of CHG-1 for modification of charge by the Co-Borrower.\",\n      \"penaltyDetails\": \"Attracts additional interest of 1% per annum over and above the applicable Interest Rate from the expiry of such time. The Lender shall provide a notice period of Seven (7) days and the Borrower agrees to pay additional interest as above on the expiry of notice period of Seven (7) days.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseNumber\": \"2.5\",\n      \"description\": \"Default Interest payable by the Borrower in case of default in payment of any amounts due under the Agreement.\",\n      \"penaltyDetails\": \"Default Interest at the rate of 1% per annum, including any taxes as applicable, on the defaulted amount during the period of default, compounded monthly and payable on demand or on the next Interest Payment Date.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"arbitration_clause\": {\n    \"amicable_settlement\": \"Not specified in detail, but disputes may be settled by courts/tribunals at Ahmedabad.\",\n    \"arbitration\": \"12.2.1: All parties irrevocably agree that the courts/tribunals at Ahmedabad shall have non-exclusive jurisdiction to settle any disputes which may arise out of or in connection with the Transaction Documents.\",\n    \"arbitral_tribunal\": \"Not specified.\",\n    \"final_and_binding\": \"Not specified as arbitration, but court/tribunal decisions are binding.\",\n    \"seat_and_venue\": \"Ahmedabad, India (courts/tribunals).\",\n    \"language\": \"Not specified.\",\n    \"costs\": \"Not specified.\"\n  }\n}"